<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - Maine State Housing Authority.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - Maine State Housing Authority.</headline>
<text>
<p>MAINE STATE HOUSING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000</p>
<p>MORTGAGE PURCHASE BONDS, 1996 SERIES C</p>
<p>(AMT)</p>
<p>Effective at 9:30 A.M. E.S.T., Tuesday, November 26, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>Fleet Securities</p>
<p>Key Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
